<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopian and Eritrean forces are conducting overnight drone and artillery strikes near Badme, wounding civilians, while Ethiopian militia clash with Somali Federalist Party supporters in Moyale, displacing about 700,000 people. The EU has allocated €550,000 emergency aid for civilians displaced by the Moyale conflict. A study reports severe disruption to regional healthcare systems and high rates of suicidal behavior among conflict-affected high schoolers. The conflict caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxNeEJBNVB0dkdmX1h1VU1fRTJkVGdQN3oyWWZlOTBqaFVPOHBIcWk2YlJ1M2poeFpLcWxlNV9rOHBQYTRwdzRaN2ZKbkNveGgyMkFBRmY1b2t4REJSampnVjdaZnlmYVA3Vm1oU0o5T093T0t0QjNQZU8xeHRzWGZRaERvVXJpUFNqZDhQcjZfSVFHSktmVGZ5anIzZWpxMXlfU0VqR2VybTFlSzl1R0M1R01IY1BEanRJSFJQQU5pLWFXMGs?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPa3JUcm9TVjVQdzNSUVJjSDVyQ2YzNThtcUZQNmxodDJFUkhYQ0s5YkpGOGRQMjhLQ2Y2QlpleUl6SlRhY2FsakVDUHE3SmdUVjI4MXlGU0doWjJBWDNFUzRQb0FJMUx6Q1g5NjQ3akxEbnFLRUVSSXViMkxYdmtOeHBmWEs3MXNqRGw4SEFBcE5RMUE1ZzJlRDRtY1B0c1FPd25YSlpGZWhJSmx5amlmZzhhRk9RQUhSTTRr?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxPenFoblQ3SmNJaDRLR2FJbklzTEpUZ3RDV09oVHdWT25ybmptT2UxUi1Jcnl6dHNFQXJhY09hQm53TG5QVFp4NTdUd1BZTldXSE0wZTZSaHFwWkJMTlktM0sybjF0NDRBYUJkTU0yMHNyVG8wRTByS2xYSlI5eW4wNjl1Q2xFbTd3bmFNX3dYSW10UEpWQjIzSW9BWk41OWJBWGkwNEF1WlpQemE3cXZr?oc=5&quot;&gt;NetNewsLedger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQVGw5amRoTWNiZXZxRC1qMmM0WHpMb3ZhZGR1MzB6T2hDNXB